     {
      "id": "slice-2-six-question-map",
      "title": "六问审理法：一张图看清完整论证",
      "blocks": [
       {
        "id": "c30-six-question-map",
        "html": "<style>.head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;align-items:end;padding-bottom:12px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--course-border)}.head p{margin:0;color:var(--course-muted)}.rail{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(6,1fr);gap:8px;margin:18px 0}.step{position:relative;min-height:150px;padding:13px;border:1px solid var(--course-border);border-radius:var(--course-radius);background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--course-accent-weak) 60%,var(--course-surface))}.n{display:block;color:var(--course-accent);font-size:28px;font-weight:850}.step h3{margin:8px 0 5px;font-size:17px}.step p{margin:0;color:var(--course-muted);font-size:14px;line-height:1.55}.logic{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto 1fr;gap:12px;align-items:center;padding:14px;border:1px solid var(--course-border);border-radius:var(--course-radius)}.logic section{padding:10px;background:var(--course-accent-weak);border-radius:var(--course-radius)}.arrow{color:var(--course-accent);font-size:25px;font-weight:800}.mistakes{margin-top:14px;padding:13px 15px;border-left:4px solid var(--course-accent);background:var(--course-accent-weak)}.mistakes strong{display:block;margin-bottom:5px}@media(max-width:900px){.rail{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)}}@media(max-width:620px){.rail,.logic{grid-template-columns:1fr}.arrow{transform:rotate(90deg);text-align:center}}</style><div class=\"head\"><div><small>方法学习 · 六问全图</small><h2>从“哪里不对”到“断在哪里”</h2></div><p>刚才：发现断裂<br>现在：获得检查顺序<br>接下来：看完整示范</p></div><div class=\"rail\" aria-label=\"六问论证审理法的六个连续步骤\"><section class=\"step\"><span class=\"n\">01</span><h3>定主张</h3><p>论证希望听众接受哪一句可争辩的话？</p></section><section class=\"step\"><span class=\"n\">02</span><h3>找理由</h3><p>哪些内容真的用于支持结论，哪些只是背景？</p></section><section class=\"step\"><span class=\"n\">03</span><h3>验证据</h3><p>样本、相关性与权威实际支持到哪里？</p></section><section class=\"step\"><span class=\"n\">04</span><h3>查推理桥</h3><p>证据到结论之间藏着什么未说出的连接？</p></section><section class=\"step\"><span class=\"n\">05</span><h3>划边界</h3><p>结论在哪些条件、范围与不确定性下成立？</p></section><section class=\"step\"><span class=\"n\">06</span><h3>过质询</h3><p>最强反方指出什么，主张需要怎样修正？</p></section></div><section class=\"logic\"><section><strong>前三问：拆出部件</strong><p>主张—理由—证据</p></section><div class=\"arrow\">→</div><section><strong>后三问：检验连接</strong><p>推理桥—边界—质询回应</p></section></section><aside class=\"mistakes\"><strong>四个常见误区</strong>只贴谬误标签；事实为真就默认足够；重述只换语气；把回应反方当成击败对方。案卷册从这里建立六栏，下一页沿同一顺序审理“社团的罪与罚”。</aside>",
        "type": "richText",
        "title": "六问论证审理法"
       }
